    'Stabilizirani Aloe vera gel 99,7% (Aloe barbadensis Mill. – pulpa lista), vitamin C (L-askorbinska kiselina), antioksidans: askorbinska kiselina, regulator kiselosti: limunska kiselina.' => 'Gel stabilizat de Aloe vera 99,7% (Aloe barbadensis Mill., pulpă din frunze), vitamina C (acid L-ascorbic), antioxidant: acid ascorbic, regulator de aciditate: acid citric.',
